Rassie Erasmus has compared Henry Pollock to Springboks captain Siya Kolisi 🇿🇦 



&ldquo;He&rsquo;s like Siya,&rdquo; Erasmus said when addressing Pollock. &ldquo;People make a big deal about certain players, but I don&rsquo;t always think the players themselves want that attention. What counts is what they do on the field, and recently, he&rsquo;s been doing that. If I were coaching him, I&rsquo;d only look at his output, and that has been exceptional.&rdquo;



